						 <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 0 auto 20px; background-color: #b7a; border: solid 1px #b7a; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.25), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.8), inset 0 10px 1px rgba(255,255,255,.6), inset 0 -15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.2); text-align: center; width: 500px;"> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; font-size: 300%; color: #fff; font-weight: bold; text-shadow: 1px 2px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.5);"> <p>开始你的<span class="ruby">梦中南柯<span class="rt">C S S</span></span>之旅&#8230;&#8230;</p> </div> <div class="unmargined" style="margin: 20px 0; color: #fff;"> <p>用这东西你就能够弄出简单的CSS主题了。如果你想要学习更多的维基语法魔术，可以看看以下的文章：<br /></p> <div style="text-align: left;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/advanced-formatting-and-you">你与高级格式</a><br /> &#8212; 由 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=318209&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605838351" alt="DrMagnus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=318209)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drmagnus" >DrMagnus</a></span> 撰写</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-style-resource">SCP格式资源</a><br /> &#8212; 由 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1722371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605838351" alt="Shaggydredlocks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1722371)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" >Shaggydredlocks</a></span> 撰写</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/listpages-magic-and-you">Listpages 魔法与你</a><br /> &#8212; 由 <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;am